virus disease</article-title><source>Emerg Infect Dis</source><year>2005</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>1167</fpage><lpage>1173</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16102302</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Turell</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Dohm</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Sardelis</surname><given-names>MR</given-names></name><name><surname>O'Guinn</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name><name><surname>Andreadis</surname><given-names>TG</given-names></name><name><surname>Blow</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>An update on the potential of North American mosquitoes (Diptera: Culicidae) to transmit West Nile virus</article-title><source>J Med Entomol</source><year>2005</year><volume>42</volume><fpage>57</fpage><lpage>62</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15691009</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1603/0022-2585(2005)042[0057:AUOTPO]2.0.CO;2</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ebel</surname><given-names>GD</given-names></name><name><surname>Rochlin</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Longacker</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Kramer</surname><given-names>LD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title><italic>Culex restuans </italic>(Diptera: Culicida) relative abundance and vector competence for West Nile virus</article-title><source>J Med Entomol</source><year>2005</year><volume>42</volume><fpage>838</fpage><lpage>843</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16363169</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1603/0022-2585(2005)042[0838:CRDCRA]2.0.CO;2</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Epstein</surname><given-names>PR</given-names></name>